                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I had the pleasure of meeting with representatives from the Utah Hospital Association, including President Francis Gibson and Vice President Dave Gessel. We discussed a range of important topics, from Medicaid to the unique challenges facing rural healthcare. It\u2019s always a pleasure to return to my roots and talk medicine again!",
