                "text": "I had a great time as acting Chairman of the Science, Space, and Technology committee today where we discussed United Staes leadership in quantum technology. As a physician, I\u2019m particularly interested to see how quantum computing will accelerate advances in healthcare. https://t.co/NTcH2ltfS1",
