                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "There are 7.6 million people on Medicaid who should not be. Having worked with families that rely on Medicaid for over 20 years, it is my priority during this reconciliation process to preserve the program and ensure it is structured for long-term sustainability. https://t.co/4UzJWFKjFe",
