                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I voted to advance President Trump\u2019s One Big Beautiful bill\u2014a commonsense package that delivers real results by: \n\n \u2705 Prioritizing American families and businesses \n\n\u2705Strengthening SNAP work requirements \n\n\u2705Eliminating waste, fraud, and abuse in Medicaid\n\n\u2705 Bolstering U.S. border security and our economy \n\n\u2705 Unleashing American energy dominance",
