                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Fixing critical programs like Medicaid and SNAP is one of the reasons I ran for Congress. I\u2019m proud that President Trump\u2019s Big Beautiful Bill includes key reforms from my Ensuring Medicaid Eligibility Act and Let\u2019s Get to Work Act to make sure support reaches those who truly need it.",
