                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "House Republicans remain steadfast in our commitment to fixing a healthcare system broken by the Affordable Care Act, which has long prioritized big insurance over American taxpayers.\n\nObamacare shows widespread systemic fraud with taxpayers on the hook for costs. In 2023, $21 billion in subsidies were paid out with no evidence of tax reconciliation.\n\nMany Americans have insurance on paper, but still cannot afford to use it. I am committed to addressing the root cause of rising costs to provide real relief for taxpayers and families.",
